- U>B | find out what they still want from the family, and make them earn it | v: power, achievement | chance: 45
- B>R | make a show of forgiving them, then enjoy their discomfort all evening | v: hedonism, power | chance: 70
- R>G | march over, shake their hand, and say life is too short | v: benevolence | mark: made a friend | chance: 70
- G>W | for the family's sake, sit beside them and talk about the old days | v: benevolence, tradition | chance: 70
