== a protest to save the local hospital
tier: everyday
at: hospital
stages: elder
age: 60-100
calls: WR
tone: mixed
life: public life, health
horizon: week
roles: neighbour, friend, a councillor, a nurse, the local paper
earth: the town's hospital is to close its emergency ward, and there is a march on Saturday
times: Rare: perhaps 1 in 5 older people, once or twice, when a local hospital or service is threatened (estimate)
