times: any time after fifty-five, sometimes more than once: per single, divorced or widowed person about 6 in 100 a year in midlife and 3 in 100 after sixty-five (D12, data and estimate, set per eligible person by the engine at pull-in, 06:29), lower for women
likelier: widowed or divorced for a while, good health, money, clubs, classes and a busy social life, a community to meet people in
