excludes: partner
domain: partner1
tone: joy
life: love
horizon: months
roles: prospect, child, friend, grandchild
earth: at the dance class, the same person keeps choosing you as a partner
scene: At the Thursday dance class {prospect} keeps choosing {N} as a partner, and tonight asks about coffee afterwards.
scene W: {N} was married for decades and believed in forever. Is there a right and proper way to begin again at this age?
scene U: {N} has not been courted since before mobile phones. There must be a way to read the signals, and {N} studies them.
scene B: {prospect} is charming, comfortable and lonely. {N} is old enough to know exactly what is on offer, and what it is worth.
scene R: {Ns} heart is pounding like a teenager's, and {N} feels ridiculous, and does not care in the least.
scene G: {N} thought that part of life had closed, like a season. But here is spring, of all things, in the seventies.
