- WRG | marry them with the whole family there, and the youngest as attendants | binds | identity | v: tradition, hedonism | tags: commit:partner | chance: 55
- WBG | keep your own homes, share your Sundays, and keep the family's blessing | v: security, tradition | tags: commit:partner | chance: 78
- URG | set off together on a long trip to places neither of you has seen | door | v: stimulation, self-direction | tags: commit:partner | chance: 70
- UBR | carry on in secret, so the family never gets a say in it | v: self-direction, hedonism | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: the family; backfire: found out, and a family row | tags: commit:partner | chance: 72
works: {N} is happier than in years, and does not hide it.
